ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=atS7QQ4KlbwQ7kNvwE4Jd-C&_nc_oc=AdovvUrlENRDqLf0x0unVVTx40TV1ZBHIhN-8ZazoHvJgTJQAAlZDSLbf39UAWWCM_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVqpnIoDOh9wXAwGNQ_dsedeQC3XUkDgFIkXZR2GwdV7w&oe=6B1035C6"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQ9fns0kMY0Q7kNvwGqgBcO&_nc_oc=AdrGxEm4VXhxF0JRultQvdjalGRfYTdUD2Wcu4n4-NLQTlhOSNuxkdHX8kd8qmwLoBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUGA_bySuYvea1u44YGkX-3d5yQree6eDqcLtOfTiUg5g&oe=6B105660"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CW2yKy5iV_UQ7kNvwE7Lvh-&_nc_oc=AdqxilEiNJEBRzEXgWyx6Y91xspdp2VCZc3wmb_EbeYgeddS3k9sP-wreOkKPmKcKlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXmpklLE2wXmJYTMQhdlGQjxoxX0hTMJw0trKh_Rb0tdg&oe=6B103CD1"}, {